    "excerpt": "Wide-leg pants have replaced skinny tights as the staple bottom wear. Here is how to achieve balance and proportion.",
    "content": "# How to Style Wide-Leg Trousers with Pakistani Kameez\n\nGone are the days when tight churidars were the only acceptable companion to formal shirts. Wide-leg trousers, palazzo pants, and flared culottes have become the epitome of modern elegance.\n\n## 1. Finding Proportional Harmony\nWhen wearing dramatic wide-leg bottoms, ensure the kameez has structure:\n- A straight-cut silhouette prevents the outfit from looking overwhelmed.\n- Side slits starting slightly above the waistline help elongate the leg line.\n\n## 2. Choosing the Right Footwear\nFootwear can make or break the drape of wide-leg trousers:\n- Pointed-toe heels or embellished Pakistani khussas keep the pants falling smoothly without bunching at the hem.\n- Ensure the hem rests approximately 1 cm above the floor.",
